% excgrid — the kernel citations.
%
% What this file is for: the BibTeX a user pastes into a paper that uses
% excgrid's kernels or grids.
%
% Where the entries come from: they are a transcription of the
% "References" list in docs/mainpage.md, which is this repository's own
% published-citation list — the works its kernels and quadratures
% implement. The bibliographic fields carried here are the ones that list
% states: where it gives a short form (no title, or an incomplete page
% range), the entry is short here rather than completed from elsewhere,
% because a field filled in from memory is a fabricated reference in a
% bibliography, and a public citation file must not carry one.
%
% Published-citation-only: nothing in this file points at the development
% repository or at any internal document.

